"""
Standalone billing report generator for SoftwareOne FinOps for Cloud.

For every organization it reports the monthly spend in its own data currency, the same
spend converted to the target currency (EUR by default, --currency) and the billed
amount, that is a configurable percentage of the converted spend. One row per
organization, sorted from the most to the least billed, with the totals of the whole
reported range and three columns per month: spending in the organization currency,
spending in the target currency and billed amount.

Organizations with no expenses in any of the reported months are left out.

A summary sheet totals the spending and the billed amount per month, broken down per
datasource type (Azure, AWS, Google Cloud), and charts the billed amount over the
reported periods, in total and per datasource type.

The only data source is the FinOps operations API; trial periods and entitlements are
not taken into account. Any failure fetching the data aborts the run: a partial report
would be a wrong report.

This file has no dependency on the extension codebase: copy it anywhere and run it.

    export FFC_OPERATIONS_SECRET=...     # operations API JWT signing secret
    export EXCHANGE_RATES_API_TOKEN=...  # exchangerate-api.com token
    uv run billing_report.py --help
"""

